\b FIEC Elevator App Staff Test Feedback\b0\par
\par
Please use the app normally and give feedback based on real experience.\par
\par
\b What to check\b0\par
\par
\b 1. Confusing\b0\par
- Was anything hard to understand?\par
- Were any buttons, labels, or statuses unclear?\par
- Was it obvious what you needed to do next?\par
\par
\b 2. Slow\b0\par
- Did anything take too many clicks?\par
- Was any page hard to use on phone or small screen?\par
- Did updating a project feel too long or annoying?\par
\par
\b 3. Missing\b0\par
- Is there anything you needed but could not find?\par
- Is there any information that should be shown but is missing?\par
- Is there any action you expected to do in the app but could not do?\par
\par
\b 4. Wrong access / visibility\b0\par
- Did you see anything you think you should not see?\par
- Was any important information hidden when you needed it?\par
- Did the app show the wrong things for your role?\par
\par
\b Please test these areas\b0\par
- Dashboard\par
- Project Status\par
- Project detail / edit page\par
- Status updates\par
- Next action / assigned person\par
- Alerts / escalated items\par
- AMC / contracts if related to your work\par
\par
\b When giving feedback, please include\b0\par
- Page name\par
- What you were trying to do\par
- What happened\par
- What you expected instead\par
\par
Use this format:\par
\par
Page:\par
Action:\par
Problem:\par
Suggested fix:\par
\par
Example:\par
Page: Project Status\par
Action: Tried to update status\par
Problem: I could not tell why it would not move forward\par
Suggested fix: Show a clearer message about the missing approval\par
